 'Legendary Creature — Nightmare Hydra', 'Legendary Creature — Shapeshifter', 'Legendary Creature — Snake Leviathan', 'Legendary Creature — Spirit Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Spirit Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Turtle Shaman', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Ally', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Knight', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Knight', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Minotaur Warrior', 'Legendary Enchantment', 'Legendary Land', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Dihada', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Jared', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Sivitri', 'Legendary Sorcery', 'Sorcery', 'Sorcery — Arcane']
